---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Evidence — Michael Rashkin" description="How I evaluate evidence, label opinion, and correct mistakes.">
  <section class="container" style="padding-top: 38px;">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Evidence and standards</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Nutrition arguments get messy when people mix data, ideology, and incentives.
        This section explains how I evaluate evidence, how I label opinion, and how I correct mistakes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top: 14px;">
      <a class="card" href="/evidence/how-i-evaluate-evidence">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">How I evaluate evidence</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">Methods, standards, and how I handle uncertainty.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/evidence/editorial-policy">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Editorial policy</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">What I publish, evidence standards, opinion labeling, and corrections.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/evidence/corrections-policy">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Corrections</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">How corrections are recorded and displayed.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/evidence/disclosures">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Disclosures</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">Conflicts, sponsorships, and transparency.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="/evidence/definitions">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Definitions</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">Glossary for common research and statistics terms.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/evidence/reference-library">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Reference library</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:0;">Optional: searchable list of citations and notes.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <style>
      a.card { color: inherit; display: block; }
      a.card:hover { text-decoration: none; border-color: #d7dbe0; }
    </style>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
